        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:c2caaa16-9277-5b9f-a04a-6f3aff4b1e10",
          "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedStringsFacet",
          "uco-observable:strings": [
            {
              "@id": "urn:uuid:a062dd41-d955-5dc9-bc2c-37146d4b5e71",
              "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedString",
              "uco-observable:stringValue": "Case: 2:24-cr-00047-DLB-CJS Doc #: 5 Filed: 10/31/24 Page: 1 of 3 - Page ID#:\n8\n\n'C:'.,\ufffd'Dfilfnct af' Kf1l'tr.1il<g'\niF!tEO\nUNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT\nEASTERN DISTRICT OF KENTUCKY\nNORTHERN DIVISION ii,TCOVlNG'TDN\nCOVINGTON faJhU\"[' lt CMF\n;;f,'P.GI< us, i.H!:iTJU>;JCotiTt'Z'\n\nUNITED STATES OF AMERICA\n\nV. INFORMATION NO. 24-47-DLB-CJS\n18 U.S.C. \u00a7 2251(c)\n\nROBERT MAXWELL WERNER\n* * * * *\n\nTHE UNITED STATES ATTORNEY CHARGES:\n\nBetween in or about July 2021 and continuing through in or about November 2021,\n\nin the Eastern District of Kentucky, and elsewhere,\n\nROBERT MAXWELL WERNER\n\nemployed, used, persuaded, induced, enticed, and coerced a minor to engage in sexually\n\nexplicit conduct outside of the United States, its territories and possessions, for the purpose\n\nof producing a visual depiction of that conduct, and intended such visual depiction to be\n\ntransported to the United States, its territories and possessions, by any means, including by\n\nusing any means or facility of interstate or foreign commerce or mail, all in violation of 18\n\nU.S.C. \u00a7 2251(c).\n\nFORFEITURE ALLEGATION\n18 u.s.c. \u00a7 2253\n\nI. By virtue of the commission of the offenses alleged in this Information,\n\nROBERT MAXWELL WERNER shall forfeit to the United States any and all interest\nCase: 2:24-cr-00047-DLB-CJS Doc #: 5 Filed: 10/31/24 Page: 2 of 3 - Page ID#:\n9\nCase: 2:24-cr-00047-DLB-CJS Doc #: 5 Filed: 10/31/24 Page: 3 of 3 - Page ID#:\n10"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
